<Base title="Contact HomeBackupCost" description="Contact HomeBackupCost." h1Name="Contact">
<h1>Contact</h1>
<p class="lede">Questions, corrections, and source suggestions are welcome.</p>
<h2>Report a correction or suggest a source</h2>
<p>The fastest way today is to open a public note on our <a href="https://github.com/pg614/homebackupcost/issues" rel="noopener">GitHub issues page</a> (a free GitHub account is required). Please include the page link, the figure, and the source you think is correct.</p>
<p class="mute">A direct email address will be added here soon.</p>
<h2>Before you write</h2>
<ul>
<li>We cannot give electrical, legal, or tax advice. Please talk with a licensed electrician for anything connected to your home's wiring.</li>
<li>How we research and handle corrections: <a href="/methodology/">sources and editorial policy</a>.</li>
<li>HomeBackupCost is run by Paul Graves in Dublin, Ohio. <a href="/about/">About us</a>.</li>
</ul>
</Base>
